    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "SHARED SUBWORKFLOW\nEngines call this to: generate captions \u2192 quality gate (optional) \u2192 post to each platform (staggered) \u2192 log \u2192 alert on failure.\nSet credentials on the LLM, Telegram, Post, and Google Sheets nodes.",
        "height": 170,
